  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/23/15/k5ms.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"500\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Valhelsia 家具模組是我們為 Minecraft 打造的家具擴充，新增了椅子、凳子、桌子、窗簾等多種物品！除了與 Valhelsia 結構模組（適用於 1.19.2 版本）完美整合外，本模組亦可獨立使用，為您的家居裝潢提供豐富的新選擇。<br><br><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/44/rj7i.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"375\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblog.valhelsia.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/網站-Valhelsia.net-F7F3F5?labelColor=030B14&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"193\" height=\"26\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/rdfQuaM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/396333981601234944?color=F7F3F5&amp;labelColor=030B14&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;logoColor=FBAA3E\" width=\"196\" height=\"26\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/valhelsia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Valhelsia?color=F7F3F5&amp;labelColor=030B14&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;label=Twitter&amp;logoColor=FBAA3E\" width=\"138\" height=\"26\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fValhelsia%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/reddit/subreddit-subscribers/valhelsia?label=Reddit&amp;color=F7F3F5&amp;labelColor=030B14&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Reddit&amp;logoColor=FBAA3E\" width=\"126\" height=\"26\"></a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>加入我們的 Discord 伺服器，獲取最新消息、更新日誌，並在遇到問題時獲得支援。我們還有極度活躍的聊天頻道及由社群成員分享的圖片畫廊。<br><br></strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fValhelsia%253fr%253dcurseforge%2bvalhelsia%2bfurniture%2bmod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/34/l9ni.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/35/cci7.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以下是一些使用我們家具模組進行裝潢的範例。您可以在<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valhelsia-furniture/screenshots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f;text-decoration:underline\">圖片</span></a></span>區找到所有現有家具及相關功能的補充說明。<br><br><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/23/15/n0ch.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"626\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzupimages.net%252fup%252f23%252f15%252fr3m6.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/23/15/r3m6.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"626\"></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">除了所有圖片外，您還可以觀看下方 Jangro 製作的模組介紹影片，獲取更多詳細資訊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wRXuIBhnBvM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<br></span></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/35/l9nk.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">隨著版本更新，我們將持續新增家具，例如東方風、提基風等主題家具。近期也將推出木製折梯、植物、精緻書本等全新裝飾品...</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/21/r6iz.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>探索我們的專案：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valhelsia-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/09/qggx.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"150\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/valhelsia-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/09/vt6c.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"150\"></a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/valhelsia-5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/44/2cpc.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"150\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/valhelsia-enhanced-vanilla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/09/gzpv.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"150\"></a></strong></p>\n\n（注：已根据繁体中文用语习惯调整翻译，保留所有原始HTML标签及格式，仅对文本内容进行本地化转换。图片链接及尺寸参数均维持原状，特殊专有名词如\"Valhelsia\"保留原文。按钮标签中的英文术语如\"Discord/Twitter/Reddit\"因属国际通用平台名称予以保留）",
